  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building justice and peace through REDUCED INEQUALITIES in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">REDUCED INEQUALITIES will empower young people to secure financial stability &amp; create economic justice in the society by engaging in economic justice advocacy to reduce corruption &amp; change economic policies to promote human dignity. The primary target group will be marginalised youth (age 15-30) some of which will be members in savings groups with particular focus on young women. The saving groups will also receive training in entrepreneurship and business skills.</narrative>
  </description>
